# Cache rules for static hosts that read this file (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify; others ignore it).
# Everything the admin loads is revalidated on each visit (a cheap 304 when unchanged), so a
# deploy is picked up immediately. scripts/stamp-build.sh additionally versions every JS/CSS
# URL, which covers hosts and CDNs that don't honour this file.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
